sequenceDiagram
  participant Tab as Floor tablet (/floor)
  participant API as API /api/v1/operations
  participant H as Handler + EF Core
  participant N as SignalRNotifier
  participant Hub as ProductionHub
  participant Dash as Dashboard / WO detail
  Tab->>API: POST /operations/42/complete {goodQuantity}
  API->>H: CompleteOperation command
  H->>H: domain rules, SaveChanges (audit + rowversion)
  H->>N: OperationChanged event
  N->>Hub: send to groups dashboard, station:PRINT-01, workorder:7
  Hub-->>Dash: OperationChanged
  Dash->>Dash: debounced reload of KPIs / WIP
  Hub-->>Tab: OperationChanged (station queue refresh)
  API-->>Tab: 200 OK (operation)
